iewing a painting that helped him recognize his feelings.\n  - Evan: Evan greeted Sam, mentioned taking the Prius for a mountain drive last weekend, and was in a minor accident on the way back. He also shared he got married last week.\n  - Sam: Sam congratulated Evan on sharing marriage news with family and wished them an incredible honeymoon filled with skiing, local dishes, and breathtaking views.\n  - Sam: Sam congratulated Evan, asked if a woman mentioned was from Canada, and commented that art is amazing at expressing emotions.\n  - Evan's kids: Sam commented that Evan's kids are having a great time.\n  - Evan: Evan congratulated Sam on becoming a Weight Watchers coach and expressed excitement for Sam's health journey.\n  - Sam: Sam greeted Evan, mentioned starting to eat healthier, and expressed sympathy regarding Evan's knee injury, asking about ways to stay active during healing.\n  - Sam: Sam greeted Evan, congratulated him, asked about a woman from Canada, and jokingly suggested putting a GPS sensor on Evan's keys.\n  - Sam: Sam asked Evan what else motivates him and commented that Evan's experience with the Canadian woman was \"powerful yet so simple.\"\n  - Evan: Evan's partner understood an accident; he promised future caution. He was asked about low-impact exercises. Evan offered support to Sam.\n  - family's milestones: Evan's partner is pregnant; Evan is excited and looking forward to building more memories with his family, with Sam offering support for family milestones.\n  - Evan: Evan congratulated Sam on becoming a Weight Watchers coach, finding it exciting and rewarding.\n  - Evan: Evan is trying new recipes to stay busy and creative, and recently started taking painting classes. Evan is also making changes to live healthier.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":2010,"context_chars":7974,"retrieval_duration":0.8760852813720703,"response_duration":5.6025402545928955,"total_duration":6.478625535964966,"grade":true,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answ