tions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Dave is achieving his dream related to making a custom car. (event_time: 2023-05-03T13:16:00Z)\n  - Dave views cars as an outlet for self-expression. (event_time: 2023-10-23T14:17:00Z)\n  - Refurbishing cars gives Dave a sense of fulfillment. (event_time: 2023-08-03T13:12:00Z)\n  - Dave is passionate about working on cars. (event_time: 2023-05-01T18:24:00Z)\n  - Dave's love for cars is reinforced by experiences like the road trip. (event_time: 2023-07-21T18:38:00Z)\n  - Dave has a dream of working on classic cars. (event_time: 2023-05-01T18:24:00Z)\n  - Dave views his activity as a passion. (event_time: 2023-10-08T15:13:00Z)\n  - Dave finds it satisfying to bring an old car back to life. (event_time: 2023-10-04T14:44:00Z)\n  - Dave dreams of someday building a custom car from scratch (event_time: 2023-05-03T13:16:00Z)\n  - Dave has always wanted to work on building a custom car. (event_time: 2023-08-11T17:22:00Z)\n  - Dave has been occupied with car stuff recently. (event_time: 2023-09-02T09:19:00Z)\n  - Dave is pursuing the creation of a custom car. (event_time: 2023-08-11T17:22:00Z)\n  - Dave is pursuing his passion for auto engineering. (event_time: 2023-08-11T17:22:00Z)\n  - Dave works on all kinds of cars at his shop. (event_time: 2023-05-01T18:24:00Z)\n  - Calvin is excited about Dave pursuing his passion for auto engineering and making a custom car. (event_time: 2023-08-11T17:22:00Z)\n  - Dave helps people keep their cars in good condition through his car maintenance shop. (event_time: 2023-05-01T18:24:00Z)\n  - Dave is involved in working on cars. (event_time: 2023-05-01T18:24:00Z)\n  - Dave gets a sense of purpose from fixing up a car. (event_time: 2023-09-02T09:19:00Z)\n  - Dave