eenagers.\n  - Calvin: Calvin had an inspiring chat with an artist about music and art, feeling a creative high. He and Dave previously planned to meet when Dave is in Boston. Dave has taken up photography.\n  - songs: Calvin's songs incorporate electronic elements across different genres. Dave noted Calvin's songs sound amazing in Dave's studio with a high-quality sound system.\n  - favorite artists: Calvin and an artist discussed their favorite artists, art, and the power of music during an inspiring conversation at a Boston gala.\n  - moment of reflection: Calvin described a moment of reflection as making the journey interesting and productive.\n  - music festival: Calvin mentioned that music festivals bring joy and crowd energy, asking Dave for photos from his recent amazing music festival experience.\n  - Japanese culture: Calvin is stuck with his music creativity but is loving getting to know Japanese culture.\n  - musician: Calvin is a musician and received a gift from another artist that reminds him to keep hustling.\n  - relationships: Performing in Boston reminded Calvin how important relationships are in his career, sparking feelings similar to freestyling with old friends as teenagers.\n  - style: Dave commented that Calvin's unique style stands out in his music and playing. Calvin previously customized an item with a shiny finish to match his style.\n  - music program: Calvin is supporting young musicians from a music program, finding their passion and enthusiasm inspiring.\n  - recordings: Calvin asked Dave if he has any recordings of his recent band jam sessions, noting that such moments sound fantastic.\n  - songs from your childhood: Dave asked Calvin about songs from his childhood that bring back memories.\n  - artist: Calvin met a cool artist at a Boston gala; they connected over music and art, discussing favorite artists and music's power to connect people.\n  - rap song: Calvin mentioned that details can make a difference, using a well-crafted rap song as an example of something made great by details.\n  - music industry: Calvin views having supportive people as vital for growth as an artist and staying true to himself in the tough music industry.\n  - California Love: Dave mentioned to Calvin that \"California Love\" is a classic song and suggested jamming to music together.\n  - new sounds: Calvin is having fun trying out new sounds and pushing boundaries, always seeking new ideas to stay ahead.\n  - sino y tu estilo: Dave advised Calvin that staying true to 'sino y tu estilo' (your style) is vital, makes music unique, and helps it stand out.\n  - live music: Dave expressed that live music is the best and wished Calvin well on tour.\n  - music scene: Calvin toured with Frank Ocean, finding the Tokyo crowd insane. He is excited about the music scene and Dave will cheer him on in Boston.\n  - album: Calvin celebrated his new album with a party at his Japanese house last week. The event was amazing, full of energy and love from family and friends, feeling super rewarding.\n  - song: Calvin recorded a song with Frank Ocean at his mansion studio after meeting at a Tokyo music festival. Calvin recalls singing along to a song during a road trip with his dad.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":1957,"context_chars":8049,"retrieval_duration":0.1294558048248291,"response_duration":4.2463343143463135,"total_duration":4.375790119171143,"grade":true,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer captures the essence of the gold answer by mentioning Calvin's use of music to express himself and work through his emotions, along with additional relevant details.","completeness_grade":"COMPLETE","completeness_reasoning":"The context provides comprehensive information about how Calvin describes his music in relation to capturing feelings. It explicitly states that he uses music to express himself and work through his emotions, which aligns perfectly with the golden answer. Additionally, it includes various facts that support this idea, such as Calvin pouring his heart into music, conveying his feelings, and viewing music as a form of therapy. Therefore, all necessary elements to answer the question are present in the context.","missing_elements":[],"present_elements":["Calvin uses his music to share his experiences and feelings","Calvin pours his heart into music within his creative haven","Calvin's music conveys his feelings","Calvin is digging deeper into his music recently to try to capture the feelings derived from people's struggles","Calvin views his activity as a form of therapy to express himself and process his emotions"]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_3","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_3_qa_10","category":"1","difficulty":"unknown","query":"What emotions is Joanna feeling about  the screenplay she submitted?","golden_answer":"Relief, excitement,worry, hope,anxiety.","hypothesis":"Joanna is experiencing a mix of relief, excitement, and worry regarding her screenplay. She hopes for positive feedback and that her screenplay gets noticed and makes it to the big screen.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Joanna is experiencing emotions like relief, excitement, and worry regarding her screenplay. (event_time: 2022-02-07T09:27:00Z)\n  - Joanna hopes her screenplay gets noticed and makes it to the screen. (event_time: 2022-02-25T13:07:00Z)\n  - Joanna hopes for positive feedback regarding her completed screenplay. (event_time: 2022-01-23T14:01:00Z)\n  - Joanna is excited about her new script, which is different from her previous work but has potential to be great. (event_time: 2022-07-10T14:34:00Z)\n  - Joanna cannot stop thinking about the screenplay (event_time: 2022-02-25T13:07:00Z)\n  - Joanna hopes a producer will fall in love with her screenplay. (event_time: 2022-02-07T09:27:00Z)\n  - Joanna hopes her screenplay ends up on the big screen. (event_time: 2022-02-07T09:27:00Z)\n  - The screenplay helps Joanna get through times of anxiousness. (event_time: 2022-01-23T14:01:00Z)\n  - Movies can make Joanna feel many emotions. (event_time: 2022-10-09T10:58:00Z)\n  - Joanna just finished submitting her recent screenplay to a film contest (event_time: 2022-06-24T10:55:00Z)\n  - Nate is eager to hear about Joanna's screenplay submission. (event_time: 2022-06-24T10:55:00Z)\n  - Joanna submitted her screenplay to the film festival. (event_time: 2022-02-07T09:27:00Z)\n  - Joanna has mixed emotions regarding the audition for the writing gig. (event_time: 2022-03-24T13:43:00Z)\n  - Nate asked Joanna how she feels now that the screenplay is finished. (event_time: 2022-01-23T14:01:00Z)\n  - Joanna has been working on a screenplay. (event_time: 2022-05-02T11:54:00Z)\n  - Joanna's screenplay might be loved by a director. (event_time: 2022-02-07T09:27:00Z)\n  - Joanna has an opportunity to pitch her script. (event_time: 2022-11-09T17:54:00Z)\n  - Joanna recalls the difficult process of finishing her screenplay. (event_time: 2022-05-25T15:00:00Z)\n  - Writing gives Joanna a chance to put down all her feelings (event_time: 2022-08-14T18:12:00Z)\n  - Joanna appreciates Nate's support regarding her screenplay. (event_time: 2022-02-25T13:07:00Z)\n  - Joanna intends for producers to check out the screenplay (event_time: 2022-01-23T14:01:00Z)\n  - Joanna pitched the script to some producers (event_time: 2022-11-08T17:54:00Z)\n  - Joanna plans to submit the screenplay to film festivals (event_time: 2022-01-23T14:01:00Z)\n  - Joanna intends for directors to check out the screenplay (event_time: 2022-01-23T14:01:00Z)\n  - Joanna finished writing her second screenplay recently. (event_time: 2022-03-18T18:59:00Z)\n  - Joanna contributed to a movie script. (event_time: 2022-10-23T00:00:00Z)\n  - The project Joanna finished is the screenplay (event_time: 2022-01-23T14:01:00Z)\n  - Joanna is the writer of the script that the actor liked. (event_time: 2022-11-11T00:06:00Z)\n  - Joanna worked hard on a script (event_time: 2022-11-09T17:54:00Z)\n  - Joanna's screenplay includes the genre drama. (event_time: 2022-01-23T14:01:00Z)\n</FACTS>\n\n# These are the most relevant entities\n# ENTITY_NAME: entity summary\n<ENTITIES>\n  - film festivals: Joanna submitted her screenplay to a film festival, feeling relief, excitement, and worry while hoping a producer or director selects it for the big screen.\n  - hope: Joanna experiences a tug-of-war of hope and doubt after wrapping up her second script, feeling a mix of relief and anxiety about future recognition.\n  - doubt: Joanna expressed a 'tug-of-war of hope and doubt' after finishing her second script, feeling a mix of excitement and terror about her work getting noticed.\n  - positive feedback: Joanna hopes finishing her first screenplay will lead to positive feedback and new opportunities.\n  - rejection letter: Joanna received a generic rejection letter without much feedback from a major company after finishing her screenplay, which made her feel bummed out and disheartened.\n  - seeing all of the characters and dialogue I wrote being acted out: Joanna experienced seeing all of the characters and dialogue she wrote being acted out, which was rewarding and the third time this has happened to her.\n  - new things: Joanna submitted a screenplay to a film contest and mentioned that people love it when she makes them new things.\n  - feelings: Writing is a way for Joanna to express her feelings, act as an escape, put thoughts down, and create something good from them, as words have a magical way of healing.\n  - script: Joanna is filming a movie from her road-trip script. An actor praised the script, making Joanna excited and giving her chills.\n  - writing projects: Joanna is busy with writing projects, which she finds to be the best thing ever, a mix of highs and lows. Writing is an escape, a way to express feelings, and healing.\n  - screenplay: Joanna wrote parts of a screenplay that appeared on the big screen yesterday and submitted a recent screenplay to a film contest.\n  - audition: Joanna had an audition for a writing gig yesterday; she feels mixed emotions but is excited, and Nate wished her luck.\n  - big screen: Joanna is writing a movie script, a love story with challenges, hoping to get it on the big screen.\n  - producer: Joanna hopes a producer or director will like her screenplay enough for it to be shown on the big screen.\n  - Joanna: Joanna is filming her own movie based on her road-trip script. She finds every day on set awesome and is excited to show her vision.\n  - romance: Joanna's first full screenplay, finished last Friday, is a mix of drama and romance.\n  - director: Joanna hopes a director falls in love with her screenplay to get it on the big screen.\n  - writing: Joanna feels she cannot stop writing recently, appreciating Nate's support and encouragement.\n  - directors: Joanna finished and printed her first full screenplay last Friday, hoping directors and producers will like it enough for it to be produced.\n  - road-trip script: Joanna is filming her own movie based on the road-trip script. She finds every day on set awesome and feels it is full of potential to show her vision.\n  - happiness: Joanna stated she will always remember moments that bring happiness and reminded Nate that it's important to stay happy and de-stress by doing what makes him happy.\n  - characters: Joanna saw characters she wrote acted out on the big screen for the third time, finding the experience rewarding. Nate inquired about the character on the left in a shared photo.\n  - writing gig: Joanna had an audition yesterday for a writing gig, feeling a mix of excitement and anxiety afterward. Nate previously encouraged her, noting her hard work and passion.\n  - feedback: Joanna received positive feedback that people are connecting with her writing, which Nate mentioned.\n  - romantic drama: Joanna mentioned a romantic drama about memory and relationships that she found to be very good.\n  - movie script: Joanna is filming a movie based on her road-trip script. She previously hoped for big-screen distribution, and Nate asked about future script submissions.\n  - Writing and creative projects: Joanna is busy with writing projects, which she finds to be a mix of highs and lows. Her journal is a major source of support for her writing endeavors.\n  - awesome characters: Joanna writes about \"wild worlds with awesome characters\" and is now in a writers group, feeling motivated by inspirational people.\n  - memory and relationships: Joanna mentioned a romantic drama about memory and relationships that she found to be very good.\n  - movie: Joanna is filming her movie based on her road-trip script. She finds every day on set awesome and enjoys showing her vision, with Nate asking about the coolest moment.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":1981,"context_chars":8100,"retrieval_duration":0.20177769660949707,"response_duration":3.059197187423706,"total_duration":3.260974884033203,"grade":true,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer captures all the emotions mentioned in the gold answer, including relief, excitement, worry, and also adds hope and anxiety, which aligns with the overall sentiment.","completeness_grade":"COMPLETE","completeness_reasoning":"The context provides all the necessary emotions Joanna is feeling about her screenplay submission, including relief, excitement, worry, hope, and anxiety. Each of these emotions is explicitly mentioned in the context, fulfilling the requirements of the golden answer. Additionally