w believes that nature makes pets happy. (event_time: 2023-06-13T17:23:00Z)\n  - Andrew believes that the animals at the pet shelter are special and full of love. (event_time: 2023-07-27T15:52:00Z)\n  - Andrew believes that animals can be peaceful and joyful. (event_time: 2023-10-13T16:22:00Z)\n  - Andrew perceives Audrey's dogs as being well loved (event_time: 2023-07-03T20:32:00Z)\n  - Andrew comments that the pets look like they are enjoying the mountain life. (event_time: 2023-08-24T00:24:00Z)\n  - Pets bring lots of joy and companionship to Andrew's life. (event_time: 2023-10-19T18:12:00Z)\n  - Andrew thinks Audrey's pups look cute and fluffy (event_time: 2023-08-19T21:19:00Z)\n  - Andrew's furry friend is his companion (event_time: 2023-04-02T14:42:00Z)\n  - Andrew has furry friends that he might take to the groomers (event_time: 2023-11-22T09:02:00Z)\n  - Andrew thinks the dogs are cute (event_time: 2023-10-01T19:09:00Z)\n  - Andrew thinks it must be great for Audrey to have furry friends. (event_time: 2023-08-16T21:58:00Z)\n  - Andrew loves animals. (event_time: 2023-03-27T13:10:00Z)\n  - Pets provide comfort to people like Andrew when needed (event_time: 2023-07-27T15:52:00Z)\n  - Andrew believes dogs make life more fun (event_time: 2023-07-08T09:48:00Z)\n  - Andrew's dogs look content (event_time: 2023-06-13T17:23:00Z)\n  - Andrew shows that he cares a ton about his pets through small things. (event_time: 2023-07-11T10:05:00Z)\n  - Andrew agrees that pets can improve people's lives. (event_time: 2023-10-19T18:12:00Z)\n  - Audrey's dogs are adorable (according to Andrew) (event_time: 2023-08-16T21:58:00Z)\n  - Andrew is glad Audrey has the opportunity to bond with her pets. (event_time: 2023-05-11T14:03:00Z)\n  - Andrew cannot imagine life without pets (event_time: 2023-08-16T21:58:00Z)\n  - Andrew enjoys checking out new hiking trails with his pets. (event_time: 2023-10-19T18:12:00Z)\n  - Andrew does not have pets right now. (event_time: 2023-03-27T13:10:0