anean flavors.\n  - her pups: One of Audrey's pups pulled so hard on the leash last Friday at the park that it busted; she chased and caught the pup. Audrey calmed her by petting, hugging, and speaking calmly.\n  - plants: Andrew mentioned getting more plants for his house; Audrey suggested plants can make a home peaceful.\n  - dish: Audrey described her dish as a tasty, easy-to-make comfort meal based on Mediterranean flavors, containing chicken, garlic, lemon, and herbs.\n  - home: Audrey finds plants make a home peaceful. Andrew adopted a pup that is adjusting to its new home, where it needs time to get along with Toby.\n  - four dogs: Audrey cherishes her four dogs, who always make her smile and give love. She has a tattoo of them and recently returned to the tattoo parlor for more drawings on it.\n  - neighborhoods: Audrey's childhood memories include taking long walks with her dog, Max, in the neighborhood, where she shared worries and hopes with him.\n  - Audrey's pups: Audrey made an appointment with an animal behaviorist for her dogs due to abnormal behavior. She also joined a dog owners group to learn better care methods.\n  - greenery: Andrew finds being surrounded by greenery to be therapeutic, peaceful, and invigorating. Audrey shared a photo of herself lying on the grass with her four dogs.\n  - moments: Audrey cherishes moments with her four dogs, stating they make life much brighter. Andrew acknowledged the sweet photo previously shared.\n  - garden: Audrey has a garden where flowers and vegetables grow. Her animals enjoy running around, exploring, and having a great time in the garden.\n  - lemon: Lemon is an ingredient in Audrey's favorite comfort meal, which is a tasty, easy-to-make Mediterranean dish featuring chicken and herbs.\n  - Audrey's dogs: Audrey took her dogs to the pet salon last Friday for grooming; they looked cute with shiny coats and behaved well there.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":1947,"context_chars":7681,"retrieval_duration"