ght vegan ice cream recipes on his cooking show.\n  - vegan ice cream recipes: Nate taught people vegan ice cream recipes on his cooking show last Monday, finding it nerve-wracking but fun, and he learned new recipes.\n  - Nate: Nate congratulated Joanna on filming her movie from her road-trip script, asked about the coolest on-set moment, and commented that her food looked yummy with nice colors and kick.\n  - salt: Salt was used as an ingredient, along with coconut milk, vanilla extract, and sugar, to make ice cream.\n  - desserts I bake: Joanna has been making all sorts of desserts (cookies, pies, cakes) that suit everyone's diets and will share more recipes with Nate soon. Nate previously made chocolate and vanilla swirl desserts and values Joanna's enjoyment.\n  - new one: Nate asked Joanna about the topic of the \"new one\" after mentioning he baked desserts and made ice cream for a friend.\n  - dairy-free chocolate mousse: Nate likes dairy-free chocolate mousse because it is super creamy and tastes like the real thing.\n  - desserts: Joanna will bring some of her dessert recipes to share with Nate, building on a prior conversation where they discussed dairy-free dessert recipes.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":2008,"context_chars":8141,"retrieval_duration":0.14337444305419922,"response_duration":3.0460197925567627,"total_duration":3.189394235610962,"grade":true,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer mentions that Nate described the coconut milk ice cream as rich and creamy, which aligns with the gold answer.","completeness_grade":"COMPLETE","completeness_reasoning":"The context provides all the necessary information to answer the question about Nate's opinion on the coconut milk ice cream he made. It explicitly states that Nate described the ice cream as 'rich and creamy' and that he felt proud of making it, which aligns perfectly with the golden answer. Additionally, it mentions that Nate thinks the ice cream turned out 'pretty good' and that he enjoys coc