ing her vision.\n  - \"Finding Home\": \"Finding Home\" is a script Joanna is writing with her writers group about a girl's journey to find her true home. She finds the work rewarding and emotional.\n  - writing: Joanna feels she cannot stop writing recently, appreciating Nate's support and encouragement.\n  - writing gig: Joanna had an audition yesterday for a writing gig, feeling a mix of excitement and anxiety afterward. Nate previously encouraged her, noting her hard work and passion.\n  - writer: Joanna, identified as a writer, experienced a major setback when her laptop crashed, resulting in the loss of all her work.\n  - book: Joanna finished writing and editing her book last week, exploring themes of sisterhood, love, and chasing dreams. The book had previously been shared with her writers group.\n  - Jo: Joanna (Jo) asked Nate if he celebrated good feedback people are connecting with his writing. Previously, she asked about a couple he met while walking Max.\n  - writers group: Joanna shared her book with her writers group last week and received great feedback. She recently finished a cute little bookmark for one of the ladies at her writing club.\n  - acting: Joanna enjoys acting, especially dramas and emotionally-driven films, and might try it if given the opportunity while currently focusing on her writers group.\n  - movie: Joanna is filming her movie based on her road-trip script. She finds every day on set awesome and enjoys showing her vision, with Nate asking about the coolest moment.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":2035,"context_chars":8268,"retrieval_duration":0.17495179176330566,"response_duration":2.7164559364318848,"total_duration":2.8914077281951904,"grade":false,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer states that Joanna's writing has made it to the big screen three times, which contradicts the gold answer that specifies two.","completeness_grade":"COMPLETE","completeness_reasoning":"The context provides sufficient information to answer the q