nk flowers.\n  - Dave: Dave recently took up photography, focusing on scenery. He chatted with Calvin about a photo Calvin shared, congratulated him on an amazing-looking event, and acknowledged Calvin's plan to visit Boston.\n  - everyday stress: Dave finds working on cars, which he does as a job, to be like therapy and a way to get away from everyday stress.\n  - Dave: Dave enjoys photography, taking pictures of local scenery. He talked with Calvin about Calvin's inspiring chat with an artist at an event.\n  - spring: Dave mentioned that Boston parks are awesome, especially in spring, describing it as serene and magical.\n  - Dave: Dave, who is restoring a vintage Mustang engine, has taken up photography, focusing on local scenery. He discussed his photography and the car project with Calvin.\n  - Boston: Calvin mentioned catching up with Dave when he is in Boston. Dave is interested in attending an event there.\n  - eats: Dave wants to visit Japan to experience the culture, good eats, awesome tech, and music.\n  - Dave: Dave's band had a fun rehearsal session last night. Last weekend, Dave attended a rock concert in Boston. Dave is also praised by Calvin for fixing cars.\n  - journey: Calvin is on a musical journey, confirmed by Dave who congratulated him on a gala attendance and upcoming performance. Dave is keen to hear about it and see a show in Boston.\n  - Dave: Dave recently returned from San Francisco with insights on car modification, finding satisfaction in fixing and improving old cars to help others.\n  - Dave: Dave previously enjoyed a card night and is restoring a car for his auto engineering goal. He chatted with Calvin about Calvin's amazing performance on a big stage.\n  - Dave: Dave inquired about Calvin's Frank Ocean tour experience and managing fame. Dave also discussed having a helpful conversation with neighbors about current events and politics.\n  - neighbors: Dave had a good conversation with neighbors about current events and politics, fi